cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ExaBench-QA in research or product evaluations, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "ExaBench-QA: A Benchmark and Dataset for Evaluating Role-Aware, LLM-based HPC Agents"
abstract: >-
  ExaBench-QA is an open-source benchmark and dataset for evaluating role-aware,
  LLM-based AI agents on High-Performance Computing (HPC) question answering. It
  provides a curated corpus of HPC operational queries, a 10-category question
  taxonomy (QCAT), five HPC user roles, and a JSON Schema for structural
  validation and automated scoring.
type: dataset
